<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―Echoing inside a dream, the sound of a clock.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I opened my eyes, the time had gone past midnight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Past midnight means today is May 6.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From tomorrow it's school again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I opened my eyes, the television was directly in front of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The movie I had been watching had gone to the menu screen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When had I fallen asleep?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Perhaps because I had fallen asleep sitting on the sofa, my body ached a little.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\過去へ馳せる.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I looked to my right, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> was leaning on my shoulder, sleeping soundly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If things stayed like this, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> would end up aching as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, late at night in early May, there was the worry of catching a cold as well.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\オープニング\21.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "-700" "-360" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, wake up. If you're going to sleep, let's go to your room."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I shook <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s shoulder lightly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n3\r\n-200\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n111\r\n4\r\n-540\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n3\r\n-200\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n111\r\n4\r\n-540\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "SE" "2000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "2000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "111" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\オープニング\23.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n111\r\n4\r\n-300\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mmh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe her sleep had been shallow; <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> lifted her head at once, and slowly.<PG>
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n111\r\n4\r\n-300\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "111" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\オープニング\24.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "111" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\オープニング\28.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "222" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\オープニング\25.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "C" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "222" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\オープニング\26.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "222" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\オープニング\27.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111,222" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? I fell asleep...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Damn... and it was almost at a good scene..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> stood up and stretched, long and hard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"This won't do... From day one of a new life, lazing about like this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> scratched her head and delivered a statement of remorse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Right now, there's only the two of us, after all..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Just us, huh. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Yeah, that's right... There's no one who used to wake me up when I overslept... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">and the one who looked after me isn't here anymore either..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even with her eyes still heavy with sleep, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> twisted her mouth sadly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There is no one left in this home now but me and <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Neither my parents nor <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s are ever coming home again, not ever...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, do you remember? That I'm a real witch."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What I had said out loud was something I hadn't been able to forget all month, no matter what.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"A witch? That's..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> said that much, then simply fell silent.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Several seconds of silence flowed between us.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, don't think about that anymore."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> has said that every time, ever since a month ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, that person died.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I might as well have killed them myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I barely remember anything about that time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But it is as though <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> knows something―that is the feeling I get.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, that was an accident. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I know exactly how it feels to convince yourself an accident was a curse or something. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But, that was..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You're right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But, I've been thinking about it a lot lately. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If only those two had had a little more courage... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If they'd had a little more courage and stopped themselves, today would have been a completely different May 6, I think. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">No, but there was nothing to be done about it, I'm sure. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">There was no choice but to do it that way."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But... but, there's no harm in dreaming about it, is there? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Just what it would be like if there were a life like that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I turned the fullest smile I could manage toward <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well then, goodnight, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I opened the door of my own unlit room―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then I let out one sigh.<PG>
The smile I had turned toward <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> vanished the instant the light falling into this room was gone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then, alone in the dark room, I thought.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I know. Regret is not going to change anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Never mind regret, the incident had been moving along somewhere beyond my control.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was nothing I could do, nothing at all.<PG>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "95" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
There were still a lot of boxes lined up in my room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Belongings I had brought over from my old home.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
These, too, I have to sort out soon.<PG>
If only those two had had more courage.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If only that person had had the courage to endure.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If only <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> had had more courage to stand up to it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even just one of those...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How would things have turned out then?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I turned my thoughts back to a month ago, when that incident happened.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
